        "docs": "# Promises\nCreates some promised verions of Backbone methods\n\n```js\nimport 'helpers/backbone/promises'\n\nawait model.fetchSync()\nawait model.saveSync()\nawait model.destroySync()\n\nawait collection.fetchSync()\nawait collection.createSync()\n```",
